@page "/thedemonprincemods"

<style>
    body {
        background-color: #060002;
        background-image: url('images/RedWallpaper.webp');
        background-size: cover;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-position: top center;
        background-attachment: fixed;
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin: 0;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ══ REVEAL ══ */
    .reveal {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(40px);
        transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
    }

    .reveal.visible {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .reveal-delay-1 {
        transition-delay: 0.15s;
    }

    .reveal-delay-2 {
        transition-delay: 0.3s;
    }

    .reveal-delay-3 {
        transition-delay: 0.45s;
    }

    /* ══ PAGE TITLE ══ */
    .page-title-wrap {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 60px 20px 30px;
    }

    .page-eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8b0000;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .page-title {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 3.2rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
        color: #d4af37;
        text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.3), 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .page-title-divider {
        width: 120px;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #8b0000, #d4af37, #8b0000, transparent);
        border: none;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ══ STORY SECTION ══ */
    .story-section {
        flex: 0 1 700px;
        max-width: 700px;
        padding: 50px 0;
    }

    .story-label {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8b0000;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .story-text {
        font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.95;
        color: #c0b090;
        text-align: left;
    }

    /* ══ BUY BOOK SECTION ══ */
    .book-buy-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 20px 20px 60px;
    }

    .book-buy-label {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8b0000;
    }

    .book-cover-link {
        display: block;
        position: relative;
        transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .book-cover-link:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(212,175,55,0.5));
    }

    .book-cover-link img {
        width: 220px;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 4px;
        border: 3px solid #8b0000;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #d4af37, 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        display: block;
    }

    .book-buy-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 14px 36px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b0000, #5a0000);
        border: 2px solid #d4af37;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #ffd700;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.25s;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(139,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .book-buy-btn:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a01010, #700000);
        box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255,215,0,0.4);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* ══ SEPARATOR ══ */
    .section-separator {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 20px 40px 40px;
    }

    .sep-line {
        flex: 1;
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #8b0000, transparent);
        max-width: 340px;
    }

    .hero-image-wrapper {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        width: 500px;
        max-width: 45vw;
    }

    .hero2-image-wrapper {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        width: 500px;
        max-width: 45vw;
    }

    .hero-image-wrapper img {
        width: 240%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        object-fit: contain;
        transform: translateX(+10%);
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(139,0,0,0.65)) drop-shadow(0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.95));
    }

    .hero2-image-wrapper img {
        width: 240%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        object-fit: contain;
        transform: translateX(-60%);
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(139,0,0,0.65)) drop-shadow(0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.95));
    }

    .hero2-image-wrapper:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .hero-image-wrapper:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .story-layout {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 40px;
        max-width: 1800px;
        margin: auto;
    }

    /* ══ MOBILE ══ */
    @@media (max-width: 900px) {
        .story-layout {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        /* su mobile le immagini si mettono in fila sopra il testo */
        .hero-image-wrapper,
        .hero2-image-wrapper {
            width: 45%;
            max-width: 200px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        /* immagini affiancate sopra */
        .story-layout {
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero2-image-wrapper {
            order: 1;
        }

        .hero-image-wrapper {
            order: 2;
        }

        .story-section {
            order: 3;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px 20px 10px;
        }
        /* reset transform immagini mobile */
        .hero-image-wrapper img {
            width: 240%;
            transform: translateX(+30%);
        }

        .hero2-image-wrapper img {
            width: 240%;
            transform: translateX(-60%);
        }

        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .story-text {
            font-size: 0.93rem;
        }

        .book-cover-link img {
            width: 160px;
        }
    }

    @@media (max-width: 480px) {
        .page-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .hero-image-wrapper,
        .hero2-image-wrapper {
            width: 42%;
        }

        .hero-image-wrapper img,
        .hero2-image-wrapper img {
            width: 160%;
        }
    }
</style>

<!-- TITLE -->
<div class="page-title-wrap reveal">
    <p class="page-eyebrow">◆ Heroic853 Original Story ◆</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">The Demon Prince</h1>
    <hr class="page-title-divider" />
</div>


<div class="story-layout">

    <a class="hero2-image-wrapper">
        <img src="images/demonPrince/RaumRender.webp" alt="Raum">
    </a>

    <!-- STORY -->
    <div class="story-section">
        <p class="story-label reveal">◆ The Story ◆</p>
        <p class="story-text reveal reveal-delay-1">
            In 1940s Germany, where the shadow of Nazism engulfs the nation, an even darker conflict
            unfolds deep within the roots of humanity. Prince, the leader of the Five Seals, fights against
            a demonic invasion threatening to destroy the Earth. Desperate to stop the forces of Hell,
            he embarks on a perilous mission to find the final member of his team. Together, they must reach
            the three Archangels and seal forever the rift that allows the infernal legions to invade the world.
            <br /><br />
            But when Prince becomes possessed by Seere, the Prince of Demons, he is driven to commit unspeakable atrocities.
            His very nature is consumed by a darkness that manipulates him from within, slowly turning him into the
            greatest threat to those he once swore to protect.
            <br /><br />
            The Five Seals soon find themselves fighting not only Lucifer's demonic armies but also their own leader.
            If they fail to stop the feared Prince of Demons, Seere, he will unleash Armageddon upon the Earth.
            As jealousy, pride, and ambition begin to poison the group, internal conflicts erupt into betrayal and violence.
            In an age where vengeance and the lust for power intertwine with an ever-growing darkness, each member of
            the Five Seals must confront their own choices and discover whether love can truly triumph over hatred —
            even when their very souls are at stake.
        </p>
    </div>

    <a class="hero-image-wrapper">
        <img src="images/demonPrince/Duncan Render.webp" alt="Duncan">
    </a>

</div>

<!-- BUY THE BOOK -->
<div class="book-buy-section">
    <p class="book-buy-label reveal">◆ Get the Book ◆</p>
    <a class="book-cover-link reveal reveal-delay-1"
       href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FP9D3JGM"
       target="_blank"
       title="Buy The Demon Prince on Amazon">
        <img src="images/demonPrince/BookCover.jpg" alt="The Demon Prince Book Cover" />
    </a>
    <a class="book-buy-btn reveal reveal-delay-2"
       href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FP9D3JGM"
       target="_blank">
         Buy on Amazon
    </a>
</div>

<script>
    (function () {
        function initReveal() {
            var els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
            if (!els.length) { setTimeout(initReveal, 300); return; }
            var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
                entries.forEach(function (e) {
                    if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('visible'); obs.unobserve(e.target); }
                });
            }, { threshold: 0.08 });
            els.forEach(function (el) { obs.observe(el); });
        }
        setTimeout(initReveal, 400);
    })();
</script>
